WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.798
So a lot of people write in and ask how
the WHY relates to

00:00:04.798 --> 00:00:06.100
the vision or mission of your company.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:10.460
The WHY is like the
foundation of your house.

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:13.360
It's there and it gives everything above it
solidity.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.500
So my WHY is to inspire people to

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.600
do the things that inspire them so
together each of us can

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.800
change our world for the better.
That's why I get out of bed in the morning,

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.961
that's what inspires me.
I look for stories like that.

00:00:23.961 --> 00:00:26.689
Now the WHY is not always good
for public consumption

00:00:26.689 --> 00:00:30.699
because sometimes the words
are clunky. Mine is a little bit clunky.

00:00:30.699 --> 00:00:36.680
And so the way you think about a vision
is if my WHY were to come to life,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:40.920
if 20, 30, 40, 50 years from now everything went
perfectly and I were able to live my WHY

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:44.510
and bring it to life in perfect form,
what would the world look like?

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:47.519
That's why we call it vision
because you can see it.

00:00:47.519 --> 00:00:49.429
My vision is to create a world in which

00:00:49.429 --> 00:00:53.600
the vast majority of people wake
up every single morning inspired,

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:58.000
feel safe at work and return home fulfilled
at the end of the day.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:02.600
That's my vision. That's the thing that I see in the
future that I want to build.

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:06.860
My mission is to commit all of my talents and all
of my energies to build that world.

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:11.570
So I speak, I write, I teach, anything that I
can do, I advise, any kind of anything I can do.

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:14.900
I look for ideas that help
advance my vision.

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:17.900
So my mission are things that I will do to help advance
the vision that I have

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:19.460
that was all set in motion

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:22.000
as soon as I learned my WHY.

